# game/case04.rpy:58
translate japanese press_reisen_1_5456b505:

    # you "What exactly is in the tonic?"
    you "その薬には、いったい何が入っている？"

# game/case04.rpy:60
translate japanese press_reisen_1_7520912f:

    # reisen "Moon herbs, honey, and something Master told me not to ask about."
    reisen "月の薬草と蜂蜜と、師匠に聞くなと言われた何かです。"

# game/case04.rpy:64
translate japanese press_reisen_2_19e2a292:

    # you "Is hearing colours a known side effect?"
    you "色が聞こえるのは、知られた副作用なのか？"

# game/case04.rpy:66
translate japanese press_reisen_2_2b47b1b1:

    # reisen "Define \"known.\" On the moon, we... never mind. No. It isn't."
    reisen "「知られた」の定義によります。月では……いえ、何でもないです。いいえ、違います。"

# game/case04.rpy:70
translate japanese press_reisen_3_8769889d:

    # you "Cleared by whom, exactly?"
    you "いったい誰のお墨付きなんだ？"

# game/case04.rpy:72
translate japanese press_reisen_3_a123ee9b:

    # reisen "By the greatest pharmacist in Gensokyo! My master!"
    reisen "幻想郷一の薬師です！私の師匠です！"

# game/case04.rpy:73
translate japanese press_reisen_3_c707d443:

    # reisen "Add that to my testimony. It settles everything."
    reisen "それを証言に加えてください。それで全部決まりです。"

# game/case04.rpy:77
translate japanese press_reisen_4_1edb4caf:

    # you "Did Eirin actually test the tonic?"
    you "永琳は実際にその薬を試験したのか？"

# game/case04.rpy:79
translate japanese press_reisen_4_46eb3347:

    # reisen "She didn't need to. She's a genius. Geniuses just know things."
    reisen "その必要はありません。師匠は天才ですから。天才は分かってしまうんです。"

# game/case04.rpy:81
translate japanese press_reisen_4_ffbb2967:

    # eiki "Her teacher's reputation is doing all of her arguing for her."
    eiki "師匠の評判が、彼女の代わりに全部弁論しています。"

# game/case04.rpy:92
translate japanese case4_c1fe0fe8:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session. Last case of the day."
    eiki "静粛に。彼岸論理法廷を開廷します。本日最後の事件です。"

# game/case04.rpy:94
translate japanese case4_0d42250e:

    # eiki "Komachi."
    eiki "小町。"

# game/case04.rpy:95
translate japanese case4_b2edef9d:

    # komachi "Defendant's here, boss. Brought free samples."
    komachi "被告人は来てますよ、四季様。試供品を持ってきました。"

# game/case04.rpy:96
translate japanese case4_ac34ad81:

    # eiki "Confiscate them."
    eiki "没収しなさい。"

# game/case04.rpy:97
translate japanese case4_4da474d4:

    # komachi "Already drank one. Is purple supposed to sound like that?"
    komachi "もう一本飲んじゃいました。紫って、こんな音がするもんでしたっけ？"

# game/case04.rpy:100
translate japanese case4_eec6d569:

    # reisen "Reisen Udongein Inaba, assistant to Eientei's pharmacist. This is all a misunderstanding."
    reisen "鈴仙・優曇華院・イナバ、永遠亭の薬師の助手です。これは全部誤解です。"

# game/case04.rpy:103
translate japanese case4_b910979b:

    # eiki "The charge: selling an untested tonic in the Human Village."
    eiki "罪状：人間の里での未試験の薬の販売。"

# game/case04.rpy:106
translate japanese case4_369229c7:

    # reisen "It's tested! Well. It's approved. By someone very qualified."
    reisen "試験済みです！ええと、承認済みです。とても資格のある方に。"

# game/case04.rpy:110
translate japanese case4_55ac6728:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. Respect your elders. Respect experts."
    eiki "見習い判事。目上の者を敬いなさい。専門家を敬いなさい。"

# game/case04.rpy:111
translate japanese case4_67312618:

    # eiki "But respect is not evidence. Remember which one you are weighing."
    eiki "ですが、敬意は証拠ではありません。どちらを量っているのか忘れないように。"

# game/case04.rpy:127
translate japanese case4_5baa0096:

    # reisen_t "I sold the tonic in the Human Village yesterday. Everyone paid in full."
    reisen_t "昨日、人間の里で薬を売りました。みんな全額払ってくれました。"

# game/case04.rpy:128
translate japanese case4_0f5a1a98:

    # reisen_t "This morning, three customers said they could hear colours. Mostly blue."
    reisen_t "今朝、お客さんが三人、色が聞こえると言い出しました。主に青だそうです。"

# game/case04.rpy:129
translate japanese case4_7f7e4905:

    # reisen_t "But the tonic was cleared before I sold a single bottle."
    reisen_t "でも、薬は一本も売る前にお墨付きをもらっていました。"

# game/case04.rpy:133
translate japanese case4_99b4e411:

    # eiki "The floor is yours, Junior Judge. Do not drink anything she offers you."
    eiki "どうぞ、見習い判事。彼女に何を勧められても飲まないように。"

# game/case04.rpy:147
translate japanese case4_cross_35e740a1:

    # eiki "Again. And Komachi, put the samples down."
    eiki "もう一度。それと小町、試供品を置きなさい。"

# game/case04.rpy:158
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_d89358d9:

    # you "Eirin's genius doesn't change what happened to your customers."
    you "永琳が天才でも、お客さんに起きたことは変わらない。"

# game/case04.rpy:159
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_cd4d5d14:

    # you "Three villagers hear colours. A reputation can't outvote three witnesses."
    you "三人の村人に色が聞こえている。評判では三人の証言を覆せない。"

# game/case04.rpy:162
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_6e1b807b:

    # reisen "B-but Master is never wrong! ...She's rarely wrong. She's wrong sometimes."
    reisen "で、でも師匠は絶対に間違えません！……めったに間違えません。たまに間違えます。"

# game/case04.rpy:166
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_b62eef67:

    # eiki "An appeal to authority. A famous name is not a test result."
    eiki "権威に訴える論証。有名な名前は試験結果ではありません。"

# game/case04.rpy:167
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_30d9ca52:

    # eiki "Experts deserve a hearing. They do not deserve a free pass."
    eiki "専門家には耳を傾けるべきです。ですが、素通りさせてはいけません。"

# game/case04.rpy:174
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_02f0da17:

    # eiki "Defendant Reisen Udongein Inaba. This court finds you..."
    eiki "被告人、鈴仙・優曇華院・イナバ。当法廷はあなたに……"

# game/case04.rpy:185
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_f8ed3269:

    # eiki "Sentence: recall every bottle, and bring this court a written test report. Signed."
    eiki "判決：全品回収のうえ、署名入りの試験報告書を当法廷に提出すること。"

# game/case04.rpy:188
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_3b6bf734:

    # reisen "Can Master sign it?"
    reisen "師匠に署名してもらってもいいですか？"

# game/case04.rpy:191
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_eb7b6c39:

    # eiki "Only if she runs the test first. Bailiff."
    eiki "彼女が先に試験をするならば。廷吏。"

# game/case04.rpy:192
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "はいよ、四季様。"

# game/case04.rpy:204
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_fa8c9b2e:

    # eiki "I keep saying \"escort.\""
    eiki "私は「護送」と言っているのですが。"

# game/case04.rpy:205
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_c3175236:

    # komachi "And I keep escorting, boss. Very efficiently."
    komachi "で、あたいは護送してますよ、四季様。すごく効率よく。"

# game/case04.rpy:206
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_71592ec1:

    # komachi "Oh, boss. A fairy at Misty Lake is selling frozen pudding. Two yen a scoop."
    komachi "あ、四季様。霧の湖で妖精が冷凍プリンを売ってますよ。一すくい二円で。"

# game/case04.rpy:207
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_bbc0d58b:

    # eiki "Irrelevant. The pudding case is closed. I closed it myself."
    eiki "関係ありません。プリンの件は閉廷しました。私自身が閉じたのです。"

# game/case04.rpy:208
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_7193588e:

    # komachi "Just saying. The cups have a little bat on them."
    komachi "一応ね。カップに小さなコウモリの絵がついてるんですよ。"

# game/case04.rpy:209
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_082411fc:

    # eiki "Komachi. A closed case stays closed."
    eiki "小町。閉じた事件は閉じたままです。"

# game/case04.rpy:210
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_c739c1fe:

    # eiki "That clears today's docket. Junior Judge, your work was... acceptable."
    eiki "これで本日の審理は終わりです。見習い判事、あなたの仕事は……まあまあでした。"

# game/case04.rpy:211
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_7e4a9829:

    # komachi "That's her highest praise, by the way."
    komachi "ちなみにそれ、この人の最高の褒め言葉ですから。"

# game/case04.rpy:212
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_0d42250e:

    # eiki "Komachi."
    eiki "小町。"

# game/case04.rpy:213
translate japanese case4_breakthrough_bd395515:

    # komachi "Escorting myself out."
    komachi "自分を護送してきます。"

translate japanese strings:

    # game/case04.rpy:10
    old "Miracle Tonic"
    new "奇跡の薬"

    # game/case04.rpy:10
    old "Label: \"Perfectly safe! —Eirin.\" Smells faintly of blueberries."
    new "ラベル：「完全に安全！―永琳」。ほのかにブルーベリーの香り。"

    # game/case04.rpy:12
    old "Eirin's Diploma"
    new "永琳の卒業証書"

    # game/case04.rpy:12
    old "Lunar Academy of Medicine. Top of her class, ten thousand years running."
    new "月の医学院。一万年連続の首席。"

    # game/case04.rpy:14
    old "Eientei Lab Notebook"
    new "永遠亭の実験ノート"

    # game/case04.rpy:14
    old "\"Miracle Tonic. Tests run: none yet. Selling anyway (Reisen).\""
    new "「奇跡の薬。実施した試験：まだなし。とりあえず販売（鈴仙）」"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "Eientei's Miracle Tonic"
    new "永遠亭の奇跡の薬"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "I sold the tonic in the Human Village yesterday. Everyone paid in full."
    new "昨日、人間の里で薬を売りました。みんな全額払ってくれました。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "A sales record is not an argument. Though the receipts are very neat."
    new "売上記録は論証ではありません。領収書はとてもきちんとしていますが。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "This morning, three customers said they could hear colours. Mostly blue."
    new "今朝、お客さんが三人、色が聞こえると言い出しました。主に青だそうです。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "That is a symptom, not a syllogism. Find the place where she reasons."
    new "それは症状であって、三段論法ではありません。彼女が推論している箇所を探しなさい。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "But the tonic was cleared before I sold a single bottle."
    new "でも、薬は一本も売る前にお墨付きをもらっていました。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "Cleared by whom? Press her before you object."
    new "誰のお墨付きですか？異議の前に揺さぶりなさい。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "Master Eirin says it's perfectly safe. So it can't be the tonic."
    new "永琳師匠は完全に安全だと言っています。だから薬のせいのはずがありません。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "That's the mirror image. Ad Hominem rejects a claim because of who made it. She's accepting one."
    new "それは鏡写しです。人身攻撃は言った人を理由に主張を退けます。彼女は受け入れているのです。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "Nobody is offering two doors here. She's leaning on one very famous name."
    new "ここで扉を二つ示している者はいません。彼女はとても有名な一つの名前に寄りかかっているのです。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "Order isn't her mistake. She's treating a name as if it were a test."
    new "順序は彼女の誤りではありません。名前を試験結果のように扱っているのです。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "She isn't pointing at anyone else's sins. She's hiding behind her teacher's title."
    new "彼女は他人の罪を指さしてはいません。師匠の肩書きの陰に隠れているのです。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "No chain of disasters predicted. Just one reputation, doing all the work."
    new "災厄の連鎖は予言されていません。一つの評判が全部の仕事をしているだけです。"

    # game/case04.rpy:17
    old "That's a reputation, not a result. Show whether anyone actually tested it."
    new "それは評判であって、結果ではありません。誰かが実際に試験したかを示しなさい。"

